What:		/sys/class/xm_power/charger/smart_charge/bypass_requested
Date:		November 2026
Description:
		Read or write the request bit for the Xiaomi MCA smart bypass
		charging policy. Accepted values are 0 and 1. The driver exposes
		this attribute on boards that declare smart_bypass_support and
		supply the corresponding policy tables. The charging worker
		evaluates the request against the board's state of charge,
		temperature, charger and scene settings. Reading 1 reports the
		request. Actual battery and input currents require measurement.
